<title>BOSNIA: Siege of U.N. police office ends -- spokesman.</title>
<headline>Siege of U.N. police office ends -- spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.N. police officials are no longer surrounded in their office and have left safely after a Serb mob dispersed in the eastern town of Zvornik, a United Nations spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The situation seems to have been resolved in Zvornik. The crowd has dispersed. Our U.N. personnel are leaving the building for a safe location,&quot; spokesman Alex Ivanko told Reuters in Sarajevo.</p>
</text>
